+0     > S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0.01  < . 1:1(0) ack 5 win 1000
+0     > R 5:5(0)
+0.01  < R 1:1(0) win 0
+0.01  < S 1000:1000(0) win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0     > S. ?:?(0) ack 1001 win 65535 <mss 1460>
